          "id": "cons-driver-underrated",
          "severity": "critical",
          "headline": "Driver is under-rated for the new stall current",
          "rationale": "The TB6612FNG is rated 1.2 A continuous per channel (3.2 A peak). A 3.0 A stall draw sits above the continuous rating, so a stalled wheel will thermally shut down the driver and, repeated, destroy it. This is not a margin question — the part is the wrong size for the motor now.",
